 VIBRATIONAL CONTRIBUTIONS TO THE STATIC DIELECTRIC TENSOR (OSCILLATOR
 STRENGTHS) ARE PURE NUMBERS. THEY ARE COMPUTED FOR EACH nth MODE AS:

   f_(n,ij) = 1 / (4 * pi * eps0) * 4 * pi / V * Z_(n,i) * Z_(n,j) / nu_n**2

 WHERE:
